    <Major>Claudio t8 crazy finisher combo</Major>
    <Description>This macro is designed for smooth execution of Claudio's high-speed, acrobatic moves with an emphasis on his cosmic-themed powers. The macro would initiate with Claudio's standard combo flow, beginning with quick punches or kicks to build pressure on the opponent. It will then seamlessly transition into his distinctive "Starburst" mechanic, enhancing his speed and power.</Description>
    <Comment>The macro would ensure precise timing and smooth transitions, allowing players to execute Claudio’s high-damage combo sequences and finisher with minimal effort while showcasing his cosmic powers in an epic finish.</Comment>
